* The local factorisation at a point about which F does not vanish identically: F is ( z - P ) ^ n times a function holomorphic on D and nonzero at P, for some n.  ~ holfacx with the coefficient family written out and its hypothesis replaced by the vanishing statement it is equivalent to ( ~ holallz ).

